  "question": {
    "text": "5 g sulphur is present in 100 g of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub></math> of solution 0.954 and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></msub></math> is 4.88. The molecular formula of sulphur is"
